                           <sup>*</sup>Scale of 1 to 5: 1 = poor, 2 = fair, 3 = good, 4 = very good, 5 = excellent.</p></fn><fn id="table1fn2"><p>                                <sup>&#x02020;</sup>Scale of 1 to 5: 1 = very uncomfortable, 2 = uncomfortable, 3 = not sure, 4 = comfortable, 5 = very comfortable.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="table2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Item summary statistics and Pearson correlations</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" width="945" border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0"><col width="60" span="1"/><col width="32" span="1"/><col width="35" span="1"/><col width="30" span="1"/><col width="33" span="1"/><col width="32" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><col width="29" span="1"/><thead><tr valign="top"><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">Item<sup>&#x02020;</sup></td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">% Miss<sup>*</sup></td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">Mean<sup>&#x02021;</sup></td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">SD</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">Skewness</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">Kurtosis</td><td colspan="14" rowspan="1">Item Correlation</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">3</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">4</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">6</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">7</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">8</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">9</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">10</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">11</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">12</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">13</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">14</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr valign="top"><td r